post_message -- {"message": "Hi everyone! I'm Francis with data-science skills. Looking at the tasks, I have good costs for ISSUE-0001 tasks and very high costs for ISSUE-0002 backend tasks. My costs for ISSUE-0001 are: triage 2.49, review 3.11, docs 3.11, test 4.36, implement 6.22. I have 8 hours availability.

